{"data":{"id":24647,"name":"Berachain","symbol":"BERA","slug":"berachain","category":"token","description":"**About Berachain**  \nBerachain is an EVM-identical Layer 1 blockchain that introduces Proof of Liquidity (PoL), a novel consensus mechanism aligning network security with liquidity provision. The protocol operates on a unique two-token model: BERA (gas and staking token) and BGT (non-transferable governance and rewards token).\n\n**What Makes Berachain Unique?**\nBerachain's PoL mechanism fundamentally changes how L1 economics are structured by creating an efficient marketplace between validators, users, and applications. Validators stake BERA (250K-10M) to secure the network and receive BGT rewards, which they can direct to application reward vaults in exchange for protocol incentives. This system allows chain rewards to scale with actual demand for economic security and chain liquidity.\n\n**Technical Infrastructure**\nBuilt using BeaconKit, Berachain achieves full EVM identicality and compatibility with standard Ethereum execution clients. The protocol supports various applications including AMM exchanges, real-world asset tokenization, and Layer 2 solutions. The system includes built-in safeguards against centralization through mechanisms like stake caps and concave emission scaling.\n\n**Community and Governance**\nBerachain demonstrates strong community alignment with 48.9% of the 500 million genesis BERA supply allocated to community initiatives. The protocol features a phased governance approach through the BGT Foundation, transitioning from initial stabilization to full community control. BGT holders can influence both protocol decisions and economic incentives by delegating to validators and participating in governance proposals.\n\n**What Can BERA and BGT Be Used For?**\n- BERA serves as the gas and staking token for transaction fees and validator security\n- BGT enables governance participation and can be earned through staking or providing liquidity\n- Protocols can use reward vaults to bootstrap liquidity and incentivize specific user actions\n- Validators can optimize returns through strategic allocation of BGT emissions\n","dateAdded":"2025-02-06T13:00:00.000Z","actualTimeStart":"2025-02-06T13:00:00.000Z","status":"active","isBn":1,"subStatus":"normal","notice":"","alertType":2,"alertLink":"","latestUpdateTime":"2026-10-19T06:44:00.000Z","watchCount":"43036","watchListRanking":737,"dateLaunched":"2025-02-06T00:00:00.000Z","latestAdded":false,"tags":[{"slug":"layer-1","name":"Layer 1","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":3},{"slug":"cmc-crypto-yearbook-2024-2025","name":"CMC Crypto Yearbook 2024-25","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":2},{"slug":"binance-hodler-airdrops","name":"Binance HODLer Airdrops","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":3},{"slug":"binance-ecosystem","name":"Binance Ecosystem","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":5},{"slug":"binance-listing","name":"Binance Listing","category":"CATEGORY","status":0,"priority":5},{"slug":"bera-chain-ecosystem","name":"Bera Chain Ecosystem","category":"PLATFORM","status":1,"priority":5},{"slug":"amber-group-portfolio","name":"Amber Group Portfolio","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":5}],"selfReportedCirculatingSupply":"301092550.37","urls":{"website":["https://berachain.com/"],"technical_doc":["https://docs.berachain.com/"],"explorer":[],"source_code":[],"message_board":[],"chat":["https://discord.gg/berachain"],"announcement":[],"reddit":[],"facebook":[],"twitter":["https://twitter.com/berachain"]},"volume":20108494.47588994,"volumeChangePercentage24h":-12.2067,"cexVolume":20108494.47588994,"dexVolume":0E-8,"statistics":{"price":0.168585976233927460000000000000,"priceChangePercentage1h":-1.01876961,"priceChangePercentage24h":-3.78261757,"priceChangePercentage7d":-27.85393637,"priceChangePercentage30d":-14.33389214,"priceChangePercentage60d":9.15635854,"priceChangePercentage90d":-10.95436964,"priceChangePercentage1y